    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "##Grid Search\n",
        "To ensure optimal performance on this new data, another **Grid Search** was conducted exploring the same hyperparameter space used previously. Since the computational time for this search is approximately 5 minutes, the best hyperparameters have been explicitly hardcoded below. This allows for immediate evaluation without the need to repeat the time-consuming search."
